                <p>Charles B. Rayner, Adviser on Petroleum Policy in the Office of Economic
                    Affairs.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d954-f2" n="84" xml:id="d954-f2-content">
                <p>Leslie A. Webb, of the Petroleum Division.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
